/v1/","context":{"app_id":4702350,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4702350","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:26:42Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4728080","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4702350-1847286114030024","game_id":"steam-4702350","kind":"announcement","title":"About this game.","summary":"Hello!Now that there's a next fest going on, and somehow there's some people checking out my game, I wanted to tell a little bit about it. This is a solo project almost entirely made by me. Sometimes my partner helps me with errors or creates tools for me on his free time. But the majority of coding is created by me, using visual scripting. And all art is being drawn by me, the biggest problem is being consistent. Especially when gap between drawn sprites spawns more than a month. My vision:I wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030024","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:50:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4702350-1845383656380426","game_id":"steam-4702350","kind":"announcement","title":"Game devblog #4","summary":"Decorations are here.Finally, after a lot of head scratching and thinking and drawing, I've applied decorations in the game with pretty much the vision I had. Every flavor will have (for now) up to 10 unique decorations to them that you can pretty much rotate, move and change order freely. There's also an update to transformation ui since the demo, now it will be a lot easier to access it, and you can also interact with it via keyboard (WASD to move, QE to rotate, ZX to scale and 123 to flip hor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T09:03:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380426","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4702350-1839676055892793","game_id":"steam-4702350","kind":"announcement","title":"Icecream, new BG and more.","summary":"Hello to all!Here's some news on what's been cooking during july. First of all, there's now a new background for making drinks, personally, I think it's turned out kinda cute.Here's a little gif to show the mood. I do hope it comes across, haha xd Icecubes!Are now added to the game as well, in the future they will also be available as a topping option (just like ice cream and whip cream). Ice cream.Finally, I had some time to draw and implement ice cream into the game! At the moment I'm not 100%","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T15:06:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055892793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4702350-1836506165576279","game_id":"steam-4702350","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2","summary":"It's time for an update!Hello, reader! This is what has been happening within the game since the last update! 1. New glass shapes!I'm so happy to introduce these, and can't wait to see what people would eventually make. We have 2 small sized cups, 2 medium sized and 2 large cups. 2. More flavours!Apart from existing flavors in the demo, there's additional 8 flavors. Peach, Lavender, Galaxy, Dragon fruit, Coconut milk, Cherry, Blue Pea, Shine Muscat (That's not present in the picture below). 3. L","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T16:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576279","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4702350-1834602721198613","game_id":"steam-4702350","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1","summary":"Hello! This is an update to where the game is currently heading, what's being cooked and currently added to the game.So far, I'm personally happy with the demo, even if I haven't heard much of a feedback. I'm also getting up Discord server and Bluesky accound where I'd be posting art related progress of the game.Priority #1My next steps are improving the cafe and making the first interior. Currently, you can only tidy up the place, and that makes it feel a bit empty. A day and night version of t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T11:51:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721198613","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4702350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4702350":"2026-10-26T03:40:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4702350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4728080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:40:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4702350","app_id":4702350,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:48Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok"